      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;oFono is an open source project for mobile telephony (GSM/UMTS). It provides a high-level D-Bus API for applications, and a plug-in API for adapting to different modem hardware.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
